      {
        "text": "Miguel Alvelo-Rivera is the executive director of the Latino Union of Chicago. He is a board member of the Raise the Floor Alliance. His campaign says he served on the Roosevelt High School Local School Council. He says he helped convert a campaign office into a food pantry that served more than 200 people weekly during the COVID-19 pandemic.",
